{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back","id":25177,"title":"God I'm terrified and I just want to warm safe and have my old doctors back","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-07T09:39:22-08:00","id":25177,"title":"God I'm terrified and I just want to warm safe and have my old doctors back","content":"Bare with me, I'm scared exhausted and just want to vent.<br /> <br /> Okay I've mentioned before in the other forum my situation. Basically I've been having serious medical problems and I was getting treated with a local health plan but my apartment lease expired and I got screwed over with this place I was supposed to move into that I found in Craigslist. So I had to leave state to move in with an old friends family, meanwhile my doctor stressed the importance that I needed to immediately continue medical treatment and make sure the people I stay with are stable, I thought they where. He was trying to convince me to move over by him for over a year because he was lonely and had no friends, and he claimed they were worried about me. I declined every time, but when I had no other option I accepted because he said this way I wouldn't have to try to beg my family for help. I was wrong, my friend misrepresented the situation, there was not enough room for my possessions, he didn't help me get a local doctor like he promised and then he essentially went on a paranoid rampage (even before this he would do things like lock me in a room when visiting his house while he showers because he doesn't allow anyone to be alone with his wife. He got set off because I tried explaining to him his behavior was unhealthy and he couldn't treat his wife that way) blaming me and his grandmother (claiming she was turning me against him) who I was staying with that we were all against him, and coerced her to eject me from the home after I had a medical episode and had to go to the ER from work.<br /> <br /> That was when I posted that other post about almost being homeless. My family either ignored my calls or refused to help if I didn't abandon my cats. My Eldest sister even basically told me to rot in Tennessee because I'm not allowed to ask the family for help unless I clear it with her first, and I had no money so I was of no use to anyone. I had virtually no money because I gave my last paycheck to my sister to help her move right before I was told I had to leave coming back from the ER. I was all on my own still recovering from the ER yet having to find a way to leave a hostile environment in a week. I had a very small number of friends who were very concerned about me and would aid in any way they could, my main goal being to get my Cats back to Michigan because my friend knew of homes they could be taken care of in, with them safe I could find a way to take care of myself. Eventually my oldest brother offered to help. I declined the first time even when I had no options because he had an awful reputation for being selfish, lazy, and deceitful and during my fathers funeral him and my two sisters secretly made arrangements to maximize their inheritance by agreeing that they would pay off only my sisters various bills if it meant they could leave my bills unhandled (which was a doctor appointment bill, and a long distance phone expenses from when I got stranded in China). I only found this out because my oldest sister's husband told her to tell me what they did.<br /> <br /> I eventually did move in with my oldest brother, under the condition that I needed somewhere warm and safe, and there was no strings attached, he agreed and tried to sweeten the deal claiming he would even come back and retrieve all my stuff. So I came with him to NC and I got to squat in his basement, it was shelter and there was food so I was happy. I didn't have any coats yet since I still needed to get my stuff from Tennessee so I didn't have any blankets. So he had a small inflatable mattress and a blanket. I was cold and I would still have health problems because of it, and he eventually gave me a second blanket getting upset with me saying why didn't I tell him I needed another blanket, but I told him several times I was having problems from the cold. Eventually we got my stuff back from Tennessee and it was filled with fleas from that wretched place. I spent the last paycheck giving it to the Grandmother who I lived with in Tennessee to pay for the original ride I got from Michigan to Tennessee, so now I was essentially broke and with a month left of two of the 5 meds I should be taking. I managed to get a mattress and but I had to by my own basic sheets (twenty Dollars that cut a huge swath of the remainder of my money), which my brother was pissed about because for some reason it offended him that I would need sheets on a mattress.<br /> <br /> So for the last three months I've basically been huddling under multiple blankets squatting in my brothers basement trying not to have my body torn apart by spasms. I eventually ran out of my essential meds, my brother mocks me for not going anywhere even though every time I go in the car with him I have an medical episode. I have to drink heated water as cold or even a lot of room temperature water causes me to ill, I have to take hot baths to regulate my temperature and sooth my muscles and reduce swelling but that is a gamble as the hot water runs out halfway in the bath. I only come upstairs to boil water and eat, they are very wasteful with food so there is usually a lot of left overs which they throw away. He made it clear I was on my own getting medical help, so I handled my appointments to get medicaid and SSI with the only help being in the form of Car rides which I have to beg for which get delegated usually to his fiancees son. It hurts for me to sit down, that's why I'm having to lie down all the time, but Car rides especially are uncomfortable due to the sitting and the temperature shifts, I have a license but I can't drive in this condition.<br /> <br /> Its been Three Months and I haven't gotten any Medicaid or SSI, I ran out of all my including my most essential medicine which relaxes parts of my body enough to allow me to go to the bathroom easier, and because of that its been harder to keep from having an episode as I have to warm myself in order to urinate. The worst part is its getting colder and colder. I'm usually warm during the day, but by nightfall it gets cold and my body aches even hiding under the blankets, one of em being electric. I try to make make emergency hot baths at night but the hot water usually is low. I get so nauseous from the pain and spasms that some days I don't even eat, sometimes for multiple days.<br /> <br /> It got exceptionally cold for a few days this Thanksgiving, and I didn't feel well since eating the meal in thanksgiving was the first time I ate a whole platefull in a week or so, and eating (especially eating late) gives me a hard time with controlling my body temp. So I had to sneak upstairs and I lied down and basically took a nap in a corner on the kitchen floor as the basement isn't heated but the house is. I feel asleep for an hour or two and it was enough to warm me up enough to go back downstairs and make it till morning when the temperature got better. It was bad the next few nights and I eventually had to go to the ER, and the local hospital didn't even have hot water in the bathrooms and the ER room was very cold and I tried explaining the cold was what was causing my body to spasm and ache and giving me intense groin pains. They eventually gave me strong pain meds. When I got back I had to pick up my meds, and its always a hassle because my brother makes a big deal about having to drive anyone. I tried going to the basement after I got my meds but my body immediately was warping due to the ambient cold so I went to the living room were there is actual heat and I laid down on the sofa and tried not to move and sleep for like 14 hours. I knew every time I was recovering from an episode this bad when I lived by myself It always took 1-2 weeks of nothing but bed rest for my body to heal up enough for me to walk around without being queasy.<br /> <br /> My brother was furious with me that I was sleeping on the Sofa, and I wasn't getting much rest because I had to go to the ER(He didn't even take me to the parking lot he dropped me off at a curb near the hospital) the next day and then the Urologist after that. Instead of getting to sleep and rest I was constantly moving only resting after all the appointments where done for the day. And I was only able to move to due to the strong medicine they gave me. On the Third day on the Sofa he got irate and woke me up (this was the first time I got to sleep in two days, yesterday I was babysitting his two kids from his EX wife that he got for the day) telling me I need to go downstairs. I had to plead with him that for Godsakes I'm trying to heal enough where I can go downstairs, my body isn't physically able to take the basements temperature. He got pissed. So when I was the only one left in the room he came in turned on all the lights, including the lights nobody normally uses and turned on the television and boosted the sound up really loud. He wanted to make it clear that above ground wasn't for me, and that I belonged in the basement. I managed to get 4 hours of sleep and I spent the next day, that was yesterday actually making calls to all the doctors and social work areas in where I lived in Michigan trying to find some way to get back there and see my doctors as I had developed the infrastructure of Medical professionals I needed in my old town.<br /> <br /> My brother is retired from the Army and he feels that he deserves the right to be retired and never have to work now that he is 42. He is going to school at the local college he says because the military pays for the school so he can directly pocket the Fafsa money and spend it on other things. He spends over 12 hours every day going into the basement and playing on Battlefield 4, while his Fiancee works all day. She provides the food with food stamps, and he reigns it over everyone because he owns the house and its the least she can do to provide all the food, do all the laundry and do all the chores and cleaning while working sometimes 12 hours a day and trying her best to raise her 10 year old daughter. They are god awful with how they treat their pets, they have a half stray cat and a kitten, and a chihuahua. Her two oldest kids used to have dogs who where both emaciated, and now only the oldest daughter still has that dog. The animal care people even came over because someone reported the emaciated dog to them but they got away with it because it was the daughters dog and she didn't live with them. The Chihuahua craps everywhere because they don't take her outside to go to the bathroom like they should, instead they just beat her and then lock her in a cage. When I let her out of the cage I get scolded, so I have to sometimes do it in secret. There are dirty clothes everywhere because they just stack their laundry baskets in the Basement and do loads of laundry without folding them, usually leaving loads still in the machine so when others come over to do laundry they just take them out and place them anywhere.<br /> <br /> I was terrified because a few weeks ago the Fiancee was sent home from work and by the time she got back she was speaking backwords and appeared to have a stroke, she has a history of it in her family and she had one before I guess. I didn't know she was back from but my Brother being solipsistic retard that he is just thought it was funny that she could jumbling up her sentences, the youngest daughter came home from school and was scared because the mom was speaking backwards and was incoherent so she went to the neighbors. Hours later my brother called me telling me in hindsight he thinks she might have stroke and told me to check on her. I didn't know she was in the house till this point so when I checked on her she was CLEARLY in serious condition. It literally took her over a minute to start talking, she couldn't form sentences, she couldn't stick her tongue out, so I knew she was having a stroke so her son drove her to the Hospital immediately. Meanwhile my brother came back hours later and then went to the hospital, they wouldn't let him inside, and he became furious. So he went back home and grabbed all her clothes from the closet and threw it on the Porch. I asked him what he was doing, and he said they wouldn't let him into the hospital to see her so he took offense thinking he was being slighted. I told him that she was completely incoherent and he shouldn't get angry without even talking to her. I told him he should be just worried because we don't even know if she is okay or dying or braindead. He didn't listen, he didn't listen and he said if she won't show him respect he doesn't care what happens to her.. Meanwhile I was calming down the 10 year old daughter who was worried her mom was dying. So I told her we should make a get well card and I found some construction paper and I cut some basic shapes using that folded snowflake technique and I had her write in. My brother was pissed seeing this so he had to comment telling her she needed to go to sleep. I cleaned the table (and the table never gets cleaned) yet my brother still wanted to make a point getting furious saying we need to clean up after wards because three snips of paper were on the corner of the table.<br /> <br /> The fiancee came back and was okay, it was apparently a brain condition that replicates most of the effects of a stroke, and can still kill you or cause sever brain damage, but she just rested for a few days. Meanwhile my Brother never said he was sorry and just pretended like he never freaked out. Yet he was too lazy to pick her cloths up off the porch. I was left once again apologizing to the Fiancee and her kids about my brothers retarded monstrous actions. I am serious this is the most monstrous reaction I have personally witness. The fact when your Fiancee is having a stroke and you try to make it about your self, and try to kick her out of the house when you don't even know if she is alive and when her small child is worried! At this point I was so ashamed of my brother, and I realized I need to be careful because if he's willing to do that then he's willing to kick me out if I inconvenience him with a medical episode.<br /> <br /> So I've been squatting in a basement for 3 months trying not to have my body tear itself apart. I've lost 50 pounds since I left Michigan in June, and I've been completely inactive so I know its a very unhealthy weight loss. I've been completely terrified as my health conditions are scary on their own since they involve testicle pains and muscles tearing themselves apart, and when he wouldn't even let me convalesce in the Living room, which was just yesterday, I knew I had to find someway to get somewhere safe. I've been getting help collecting info and calling social workers in Michigan with my Friend, and my brother in Texas (I have two older brothers that are my cousins but my family adopted them when we moved to the US from the Philippines during the eruption of Mount Penitubo) as he is literally the only family member that would help me and he trying to send me a space heater, and some essentials like insulated socks (I've been wearing the one pair of socks for 6 months because they are the only ones I have warm enough but they are disintegrating). He didn't realize the situation was so bad and was for some reason surprised when I said I was terrified thinking I was exaggerating. I explained to him getting back from the ER my testicles hurt so bad and how terrifying it is when it feel like your genitals are destroying themselves, and how insanely horrifying it is even under optimal conditions but the fact that I wasn't able to have someplace warm and safe to recover is very difficult for me to feel like I can survive. So my brother in Texas is finally taking me seriously that I'm in danger. He wanted to talk to my brother her but I told him not to right now because I need to heal enough to survive, because I seriously fear for my health and even life (and my Cat's lives) if I was ejected under my current state. I need at least a couple more days of rest. I was supposed to see a urologist months ago but they scheduled the appointment for a month and when it got time they denied me because I had no insurance or money, but when I recently went to the ER they told me they cannot legally turn you away when your refferred by the ER so when I mentioned that to the Urologist they accepted a few hours after the phone call because they were afraid of getting in trouble.<br /> <br /> So here I am in the basement typing this, luckily its warm. I'm scared but I'm trying to spend the day healing. My sociopathic brother doesn't care about anything but himself, I couldn't go back to sleep because he came to the basement at 6:00 AM to play Battlefield in the other Room. He's been married already 3 or 4 times and doesn't know that he shouldn't be married because he is a self centered sociopath. He admits at least that he knows he's lazy but he feels such entitlement. He is stingy, but yet he tries to solve all his problems by throwing money at it! He gets his two daughters every other weekend but instead of spending time with them he just got them each a laptop and a bigscreen TV, and he goes off to play his own games. He has the money to pay buy the Fiancee's medicine which she NEEDS but can't afford, yet he doesn't buy it for her because he knows the same money could instead be spent on steak dinners and electronics. He's empty inside and and can't meaningfully connect with anyone but tries to fill his void with toys. He tries to play off that he can't afford the basic stuff like supporting the house and his fiancee, yet at the same time he brags about how he could easily afford all the food and even buys like a 7 thousand dollar computer at a moments notice. Instead of helping his fiancee, he spent 800 dollars on fancy wood to build his own pidgeon coup, and then bought a couple dozen fancy pidgeons (that really seems crazy, like its a mid life crisis type of insane). He buys a brand new car, and spends several grand on an engagement ring instead of just treating his fiancee with respect, civility and attention. He has an indulgent personality and smokes like two packs of cigarettes a day, and eats junkfood all the time, yet he can't buy fresh vegetables and fruit for the house?<br /> <br /> I'm exhausted and terrified and just trying to survive! I only have one friend who I can call to vent to, and that's been a lot of help and like I said he's been trying to help me. But I just want to go back to Michigan and resume my medical treatment, but even if I could go back there I have no place to live, and I need to restart a medical plan, but at least the Town had an excellent Free Clinic, and the Hospital was really exceptional, especially compared to the one where I am at now. And my Cats have been stuck in a dark basement with me, suffering from fleas which I'm trying to take care of. They used to be sooo happy and vibrant, but now the kitten is scared of all cats besides her sister. When I was having my spasms during Thanksgiving I had to just hold my kitten in the cat carrier to keep her from crying cause she was in heat and was afraid that if she annoyed my brother or his fiancee me and my cats would be ejected.<br /> <br /> I know I've been ranting but I really needed to get this off my chest, and since I've been bedridden for the last 3 months I've spent the whole time just trying read PDFs, watch shows on my laptop, and go on this forum. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But thank you for listening to my rant... this probably ended up insanely long but I'm terrified about my health and safety, and I'm even wishing I could even go to Canada now.... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T09:58:10-08:00","id":25199,"title":"","content":"I'm just happy you feel comfortable enough to vent over here. Its healthy and for the best that you feel like this. If you need to vent again make a post again or send me a PM if you want to. You'll be in my thoughts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:05:17-08:00","id":25203,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much. I needed to. I've been having health problems for the last 7 years and its been ruining my life, and now I'm hitting rock bottom, and the last year and a half its gotten so bad I've been constantly going to the ER. My doctors weren't taking it seriously unless they saw me in the middle of an attack. And now I have no more income and I'm just scared and terrified and dropping F bombs for the first time in my life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:11:30-08:00","id":25210,"title":"","content":"And for the last 7 years I've been keeping my health problems a secret from virtually everyone it was personal and my Dad was dying of cancer at the time as well and he finally passed in 2009, I only had to reveal my health problems after the last year and a half because I couldn't hide it anymore. I didn't want to get SSI because I felt it was bad luck when I was trying to heal and I know I would get stigmatized for being a cripple.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:17:07-08:00","id":25215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25210#post25210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And for the last 7 years I've been keeping my health problems a secret from virtually everyone it was personal and my Dad was dying of cancer at the time as well and he finally passed in 2009, I only had to reveal my health problems after the last year and a half because I couldn't hide it anymore. I didn't want to get SSI because I felt it was bad luck when I was trying to heal and I know I would get stigmatized for being a cripple.</div> </div> </div> </div>that's why I haven't applied for it. I don't want it to interfere with my life anymore than it does already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:24:22-08:00","id":25221,"title":"","content":"My god. We don't know each other well, Eldagusto, we've just brushed past each other's lives on fun little what-if posts on tabletop games forums, but after reading that I feel responsible to let you know at least that one more person feels for you and cares whether you make it. I'm in no position to aid financially, being in a bit of a hole myself (but nothing resembling the horror you're going through), so I feel a bit inadequate, but please, take care of yourself as best you can, keep in contact with your brother in Texas and be as open with him as you can, try to endure the pain, but most of all, keep taking care of yourself. Your health is what matters most, and anybody who can't recognize that isn't worth your time or respect, as unfortunate as you are to be surrounded by them at this time.<br /> <br /> If you manage to extract yourself from this situation and get the help you deserve, please let us know. But above all, I just hope you and your cats make it for yourselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:26:19-08:00","id":25223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25215#post25215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> that's why I haven't applied for it. I don't want it to interfere with my life anymore than it does already.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yet as I pointed out my eldest sister disowned me because she told me it was irresponsible of me to not get SSI a year ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:32:24-08:00","id":25225,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://s1236.photobucket.com/user/ArcaneArtsCreativeStudios/media/last_moment_with_dashie_by_blackgryph0n-d4lzy9p.png.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1236.photobucket.com/albums/ff449/ArcaneArtsCreativeStudios/last_moment_with_dashie_by_blackgryph0n-d4lzy9p.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:40:31-08:00","id":25231,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That's one of the hardest parts, since my exodus its been six months since I've lived anywhere near my friends. It takes a toll by itself just being away from friends, much less being surrounded by hostiles, much less really any of my medical situation. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:52:28-08:00","id":25240,"title":"","content":"You're always welcome to vent, we all understand the need to.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Honestly? I'd suggest medicaid/SSI. It's a not-great social safety net, that I feel is underfunded but it's there for a reason. Because it is, at times, needed and people in general are terrible at planning. You pay into when you can and take out from it when you can't. It's not like it's theft or something wrong.<br /> <br /> <br /> Apart from that... not a hell of a lot I can do. Well, if you're not used to basement living I can offer a few suggestions that might help.<br /> <br /> The concrete is going to be sucking up heat making it cold. So if you're sleeping on an airbed, one of the best things I can recommend is seeing if there's a way to raise it up. Some storage boxes or even milk crates spread out and then putting the mattress on top? a heck of a lot better than on the ground. plus if you can wiggle things around a bit you can make a space in the middle of it if you happen to have a space heater. This can take your airbed from something that saps heat from you all night long into something that keeps warming you all night. Just be careful to set it up so that there is space around the heater and so that even if the air mattress deflates it doesn't contact the heater.<br /> <br /> Watch the amount of sunlight you get. I know from my days living in a basement it's an issue. When you don't get enough people tend to get into a depressive spiral, which just causes problems. Somehow I doubt you have much influence over what the place looks like, but bright colours can also help a bit.<br /> <br /> You could also partially block some of the heating ducts to direct more heat into the room you are in, at the cost of less heat going to the rest of the house (mostly upstairs)... which would cause someone to raise the temperature. (oh noes).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T10:56:31-08:00","id":25245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25221#post25221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My god. We don't know each other well, Eldagusto, we've just brushed past each other's lives on fun little what-if posts on tabletop games forums, but after reading that I feel responsible to let you know at least that one more person feels for you and cares whether you make it. I'm in no position to aid financially, being in a bit of a hole myself (but nothing resembling the horror you're going through), so I feel a bit inadequate, but please, take care of yourself as best you can, keep in contact with your brother in Texas and be as open with him as you can, try to endure the pain, but most of all, keep taking care of yourself. Your health is what matters most, and anybody who can't recognize that isn't worth your time or respect, as unfortunate as you are to be surrounded by them at this time.<br /> <br /> If you manage to extract yourself from this situation and get the help you deserve, please let us know. But above all, I just hope you and your cats make it for yourselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you, it really does mean a lot. I'm trying to be open with my brother in Texas, he used to actually be my hero growing up but then I started realizing my family really preferred to not talk to me since I grew up away from most of them and I realized even he didn't really like me when I visited him a few months before my medical problems started because I didn't drink and was quiet. But the important thing was I at least knew he wasn't a human monster, to many of my other family members have expressed deplorable qualities. I was never good with family politics because I was the youngest and I would either express my opinions honestly or I would just shut the hell up.<br /> <br /> But a lot of this has isolated me from many of my friends. Nobody wants to hear about others problems, and most of them were used to venting their problems to me rather then me talking about my own issues. So even before I left Michigan a lot of my friends drifted away from me when my health declined. If anyone remembered the old post I had a couple years back when I burned my hand, too many of my friends just ditched me when I was healing my hand even though I burned my hand cooking for them while hosting a game night at my apartment.<br /> <br /> A handful of friends I trust and have stuck with me, but they are too few in number, and they are often in dire situations themselves.<br /> <br /> But yeah when friends abandon you when you can't move around from healing, they are not really very good friends. And the really good friends that show empathy often do it because they learned the hard way what its like to have hard times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T13:50:14-08:00","id":25330,"title":"","content":"O.O that seems quite a dire situation...perhaps Hatewheel is not the only one who should have a GoFundMe going on around here","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T14:36:13-08:00","id":25351,"title":"","content":"*BIG HUG*<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm so sorry you're going through so much, Eldagusto. I can see if sometime after Christmas if I can send some canned goods and such your way. Just not sure how much it would cost ( live in Norway ). But I don't like knowing that some of my friends on the forums I'm on have to live like that with so little help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T14:52:39-08:00","id":25355,"title":"","content":"I don't have a problem if you rant here. It can help you feel better. There is also problems<br /> <br /> Its unfortunate to hear that you have been suffering from significant medical problems, and you can't seem to rely on family and friends (most of them anyways) for help. The world is a better place when people help each other through their troubles, not when they exploit others or basically let them die. It seems like a waste to spend a lot of resources to raise a person from infant to adult, but then allow them to slowly die.<br /> <br /> I don't know what you're bother's problems are, but he seems unable to connect the dots needed to realize when there is a problem and that he ought to do something about it. Unfortunately, there are people out there that who really can't care, and grow most annoyed when someone in trouble makes a reasonable request for help. It probably doesn't help you that many people have difficulty realizing that other people think differently than they do. It can be difficult for others to grasp that someone could be that neglectful.<br /> <br /> So yes, if he is treating you poorly, his animals poorly, and even his fiancee poorly, then you should be looking for some place better that will give you the help you need. I don't know if you will find it, but its better than wasting away doing nothing.<br /> <br /> I don't know what I can do to help beyond wishing you well though. I'm not exactly well equipped to offer help to someone I don't know. I hope you find someone who can help you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T15:09:03-08:00","id":25364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25330#post25330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">O.O that seems quite a dire situation...perhaps Hatewheel is not the only one who should have a GoFundMe going on around here</div> </div> </div> </div>No I can't ask for that, I'm not asking for hand outs, I'm just scared, and hurt and I wish the friggin government would help help. I wouldn't of been forced to move out of Michigan if they gave me the Bridge Card (that is food stamps) but they kept on asking for things until I wasn't able to deliver on time, and dodging my calls. Seriously I was supposed to get my health plan upgraded, and get 800 dollars worth of backed food stamps, the only thing I was missing was a letter or email from either of my sisters saying they gave me 300 dollars twice to pay for rent. They brushed me off till it was too late and I missed it, and I was denied. A lot of the people responsible for the foodstamps are friggin lazy/corrupt, and they have a certain quota and once they assign a certain amount of Bridge Cards they are discouraged from signing out more. I was trying for a year to get them because I really needed them, and they knew since I didn't have a car and was having issues they could get me to fail by ignoring my calls and ask for more Proofs after each one I turned in.<br /> <br /> I feel bad because if this was me a year ago I would donating to Hatewheels help thing.<br /> <br /> My bills and credit are already ruined from my ER trips, I need MEdicaid/SSI and competent doctors. I feel like raising money for me will be a waist because I don't even know what I'm doing. I only started doing taxes a couple years ago, and I always paid my school bills on time, now I'm in over my head and I just wish I had a family, a real family that loved rather this crap where everybody is motivated primarily by money, and secondarily by politics. The only reason I'm treated this way is because he can get away with it because he feels he is the only one that stepped and he has no accountability, and the other members of my family prefer to just duck their heads in the sand and hope I die or go away.<br /> <br /> If my mother was alive none of these people would be treating me this way. In fact every other member of my family had the benefit of their parents bailing them out of their problems. I'm the youngest, my parents passed away while I was young. My Dad made me get a cystoscopy (and if you don't know what a cystoscopy is its when they take a robotic tendril and jam it through your Urethra and push through all your muscle sphincters by force till they can get to your bladder and take pictures, this is what scarred me!) to see why I peed blood a small amount of blood. It showed I had no problems except after the Cystoscopy my insides were mutilated. I should have seen the doctors immediately but my father just said ignore it and it will go away. Then he died of Cancer a few years later, while my body is falling apart. It literally feels like I'm being turned inside out starting from groin spreading outwards. I'm scared because I'm always on my own and I've had to handle this by myself and I don't know what I'm doing. The My Eldest Brother and two sisters just swarmed like Pirhana's taking the inheritance and any mementos they could get their hands on. The only thing I made sure to get was the painting of my Mom, and I let them fight it out over the jewelry and what have you. We were all supposed to chip in for the Funeral and things but my Eldest Brother (Who I'm staying with) just ditched that because he said he wouldn't help pay unless they gave him my parents wedding ring so he left. Meanwhile I live nearest my sister who was handling the estate so I was the one they carved the extra money out of to make a difference. Yet my Brother doesn't like talking about when he lets me live with him, how I had to pay a few thousand dollars because he screwed us over. He also was taken by surprise when I told him I found out about them making a secret deal to not handle my emergency bills in exchange for only paying for my sisters bills.<br /> <br /> I hate it having these people as my family who smile and pretend to be loving, yet will friggin stab you in the back for such a petty amount of money, and then when you are rock bottom they try to extort you situation so you owe them! When everyone came over for the Funeral they all treated me like crap, and the only person I had to talk to was my Friend from college ()the one whose helping me now), till one of my aunts showed up told everyone they should be ashamed of themselves for how they were acting. I know my family hates me because I'm of no use to them, and they know there are no repercussions for ignoring me or treating me poorly. That's why I can at least talk to my brother in Texas, even though I know he resents me for being poor and crippled, he at least isn't a vicious greedy piranha. He wasn't part of the Inheritance because he was adopted when he was already a teenager, but from my perspective as the Youngest he was the only sibling I had that was responsible, and him and my other adopted brother are the only ones who made a life for themselves without assistance.<br /> <br /> I just wish I had Parents to help me in this situation, everyone else had help with medical and car bills! I didn't even get proper driving instructions because my dad was used to just letting the school handle that, and by the time It was my turn to get a license the school changeds so the parents had to teach their kids to drive!<br /> <br /> I just wish I had a family! Thats why I consider my small handful of friends closer family then my blood relatives, because they at least tried their best to help me when I was in serious danger! And they are young people like me with less to give but they tried anyways! <br /> <br /> The Government is slow stingy and corrupt! And most of the Doctor, Particularly the Urologists don't give a crap! They only say just deal with it because they are used to handling elderly patients, and if they aren't finding cancer or kidney stones they don't want to bother with helping with anything else! And my other doctors were not understanding how this was ruining my life! Having to take a fist full of 5 different kind of constantly changing pills every day multiple times a day! And then no advice what so ever for when I have my spasm and my testicles recede deepling into my body and feels like they are being crushed! They don't give me any advice! And half the time they don't even give me pain killers because if I end up waiting hours too long in the emergency room my testicles descend, and the medicine they give me calm the spasm so when the ER doctors finally check me up they say ohh I don't see anything wrong your just sore for some reason! But when the Doctors do check me up during a massive attack then they say I need to see my normal doctors or a Urologist, but the Urologist doesn't take the ER report Seriously and brushes it off!<br /> <br /> \u200bIF they gave me actual help from the beginning it wouldn't have gotten this far! If I got actual medical appointments instead of just being sent off to college and only doing appointments every 6 months (my college was far away)by that time the Doctors forget who I even am and start over again). And instead of helping drive me to appointments my father was taking me too before he died my sister just leaves me on my own. Luckily I moved to my college town where I could try to find a free clinic and I had some friends to help drive me to far away appointments.<br /> <br /> I just can't take it. The only ones who ever put my interests above their own were my mom and my dog, and my mom died when I was five, and my dog when I was 12.<br /> <br /> I'm not getting another cystoscopy from the local incompetent doctors! That's what started the whole mess! Especially not when other doctors want to do other less invasive tests, and my regular doctors in Michigan don't even think I should see a Urologist they have me see a Muscle Skeletal Doctor!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T15:21:05-08:00","id":25377,"title":"","content":"Oh and I just went upstairs and had to take a bath and it helped immensely because it made the swell go down, but I had a hard time because I had to take a cane to help me, and hold my towel, and bring my thermos mug to boil water to drink up there. Meanwhile everyone laughs at me feebly having trouble walking while holding my groin. Nobody offers to help set the bath, or even boil my damned water for me. And my Nieces are apparently visiting, and I haven't even gotten to spend much time with them my whole time here because I usually am bedridden with an episode when they visit and I know that if I had to go to the ER when they are visiting that would just my brother an Excuse to kick me out. Yet the young kids are the only ones who notice I'm in pain and show concern for my well being...<br /> <br /> Oh and my brother just casually asks if I stole friggin 19 dollars from him because he can't find it in a cabinet, you know thats not insulting or anything. I tell him I didn't steal his money, and the only suspicious activity I saw was some friend of the Fiance's son rummaging through their medicine cabinet when no one was in the room claiming he was looking for head medicine.<br /> <br /> I haven't asked for anything besides rides, I even wash all my own dishes if I'm feeling well I wash the horrible pile of unwashed dishes that no body bothers with all week, yet my brother looses and breaks everything and is always blaming everyone else for EVERYTHING.<br /> <br /> Gah and it is getting cold today, I just hope I can manage to keep warm enough to heal enough so I can walk tomorrow without a damn cane. If I could I would sleep 24 hours just so I could heal, but everyone always makes noise, and leaves the light on in the basement when they do their laundry, and my brother spends literally half the day playing his stupid computer games!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Buuuut I feel oodles better venting on this here thread. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T15:31:28-08:00","id":25389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rayvin Miyu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25351#post25351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*BIG HUG*<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm so sorry you're going through so much, Eldagusto. I can see if sometime after Christmas if I can send some canned goods and such your way. Just not sure how much it would cost ( live in Norway ). But I don't like knowing that some of my friends on the forums I'm on have to live like that with so little help.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohh Jesus your kind, no that is not necessary I can survive off most any food, and the biggest reason I lost 50 pounds in half a year is because of nausea. Hell I was overweight because I was inactive due to my worsening symptoms, but after I lost my home I lost my weight while still being inactive. Last time I was this skinny was because I was exercising every night (since night time was the only time I could have the house to my self when I came home from the summer living with my dad and sister), doing the treadmill while Duck Dodgers was on, and sit ups/crunchers/ squats during the opening themes for Anime DVDs or other shows, and of course pausing the tv during commercials to read white wolf. But after my dad died in 2009 a year later after all my roommates moved away I stopped exercising and degenerated.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to be healthy though, and if I can get somewhere safe like in summer or so and if I can at least get my medical situation handled enough where I am not spasming every day I think exercising again will be good physical therapy. I wish I didn't have to loose my Punching bag in Tennessee... I miss it soo <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T15:57:12-08:00","id":25409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DivineWrath</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25355#post25355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't have a problem if you rant here. It can help you feel better. There is also problems<br /> <br /> Its unfortunate to hear that you have been suffering from significant medical problems, and you can't seem to rely on family and friends (most of them anyways) for help. The world is a better place when people help each other through their troubles, not when they exploit others or basically let them die. It seems like a waste to spend a lot of resources to raise a person from infant to adult, but then allow them to slowly die.<br /> <br /> I don't know what you're bother's problems are, but he seems unable to connect the dots needed to realize when there is a problem and that he ought to do something about it. Unfortunately, there are people out there that who really can't care, and grow most annoyed when someone in trouble makes a reasonable request for help. It probably doesn't help you that many people have difficulty realizing that other people think differently than they do. It can be difficult for others to grasp that someone could be that neglectful.<br /> <br /> So yes, if he is treating you poorly, his animals poorly, and even his fiancee poorly, then you should be looking for some place better that will give you the help you need. I don't know if you will find it, but its better than wasting away doing nothing.<br /> <br /> I don't know what I can do to help beyond wishing you well though. I'm not exactly well equipped to offer help to someone I don't know. I hope you find someone who can help you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you, and don't feel sad cause you can't help because like I said this isn't a thread asking for hand outs. I'm receiving a lot of help here just from getting all this off my chest and knowing that people are sympathetic.<br /> <br /> Its just I grew up and I know I have a lot of faults, but when you suffer especially at a young age you either grow sympathetic or cruel. And I've always used my family as a moral compass, kind of the Bridge to Nowwhere myth of knowing what not to do. I can't stand it that I'm in a position where I have to let friggin animals be neglected/abused. My oldest cat has a chunk of her upper lip cut/missing and that seems like an odd scar to get from another cat so I can't help but imagine some human did that to her in this damn house!<br /> <br /> I can't take it when I see peoples family screw them over, or when people use illness or injury as a leverage! (I was once homeless for a couple weeks when I was 19 for demanding that my house act civily and honor basic human dignity. I was arguing about needing driving instructions, but that the fever medicine they gave me was making me drowsy so I shouldn't drive the drive home, and my sister was prodding my father that I was insulting her and I was kicked out in the rain while I was sick! Part of me felt it was funny because it was soooo insanely dramatic and the only thing I took was a suitcase with towels and my moms painting insided. My Cell got damaged in the rain, and so everytime I used it from that point till it was replaced years later my dad always got embarrased by the number 6 didn't work and that was a reminder of when he through his sick son out in the rain. Ohh that was such an angsty moment :P.<br /> <br /> But seriously I can't stand it, and I've even supported numerous friends who were temporarily homeless, either cause their mom kicked them out, or their house burned down or they were kicked out by their significant other. I've done this multiple times, even giving my own room if the friend is female, and sleeping on the floor or futon for months, because I can't stand when people are abandoned by their family, and because I knew what it was like. Yet finally this happens to me.... and I literally have no one that I could find shelter with. One guy who I helped said he would return the favor if I was ever in need, but when I finally needed shelter he literally dodged my calls...<br /> <br /> :P<br /> <br /> But not everybody abandoned me, two or three people tried to help me, they just didn't have anywhere I could stay because they were living with other people themselves... :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T16:42:44-08:00","id":25422,"title":"","content":"Here's something that may be of concrete help... 211us.org It's a website that has lists of phone numbers for organizations for people who are in need. The main site has a better explanation of what it does; if you like what you see, click through to &quot;find my local service&quot; or something like that, and you can search by zip code or town, or even just state. It can't hurt to make a phone call, and the organizations that you'll get connected to are designed to help folks with a variety of issues; I suspect you'll be able to get *something* going on, even if it's just a live voice to talk to. I sincerely hope that this helps, even if it's just the offer of help. (Thought, honestly, I really do hope that you're able to get connected to some helpful folks through this.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Formerly Scathach of the White Wolf forums. Still my pretty, one-winged ducky face, though.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/980-daffiroth","name":"Daffiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar980_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T17:19:45-08:00","id":25435,"title":"","content":"Thank you, I will look into this, looking up various numbers was difficult, though my friend may have used this when trying to help me make calls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T08:14:47-08:00","id":25794,"title":"","content":"You'd almost have to know better than I would how dire your situation is, Eldagusto, so I won't second-guess your decision not to accept donations. I'll just tell you I hope your situation improves soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T09:38:10-08:00","id":25840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25794#post25794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You'd almost have to know better than I would how dire your situation is, Eldagusto, so I won't second-guess your decision not to accept donations. I'll just tell you I hope your situation improves soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its just in my experience everyone resents me for any sort of help they give me, and money is scary as in my experience my family would die through neglect if they could do it in a way that there is no splashback. I'm not someone important, I'm not a child in danger, and I'm not even anyone livings kid. I was taught to be ashamed for asking for help, or try to get help from the government. My father hammered into me at a young age that I shouldn't reach out to family for help since they have no obligation to help me, these sentiments were backed by various family members both subtly and bluntly. Like I've said even people I've aided at great cost to myself for no compensation would be offended if I were to ask for aid.<br /> <br /> Everyone's going through harsh times so you shouldn't feel bad that you can't help someone you know on the internet, just if I make it a non issue that at least saves people guilt and grief and handle their own bills or other people in need that can actually be helped. I feel like a lost cause in so many ways, like if you go through the trouble of trying to help me (and it is trouble) and I fall apart anyways then were just screwed.<br /> <br /> However the moral support, and advice and information is genuinely helping me. It would endanger, or even sacrifice that if I was asking for handouts, like I said I'm blacklisted by half my family calling them from the ER telling them I'm scared and I need advice and any form of shelter I can get. I truly appreciate this community and I can't afford to lose it.<br /> <br /> I managed to sneak upstairs at night and sleep on the couch and it was so warm and so much pain and swelling was going away, but now that its daylight I'm back in the basement. My brother just talked with saying all this BS about how he's there for me and how I'm only cold because I'm stupid and can't figure out how to use a blanket. And how he has my back but its clearly everyone else in the house that s against me. I'm Effen Bedriddin and I have to pack all my belongings into a room that he already filled with all of his own garbage, it hurts for me to bend over in the room or to do anything away from the heated bed, and I have no drawers or shelves yet he insults me about why I don't put my stuff in these no existent places. He talks about me behind my back mocking my medical conditions, but not very stealthily, but then tries to pretend like he's sympathetic doing everything he can for me. I'm literally about to fall down several times, having trouble moving and he gets pissed about me using the bath too much because there is water on the floor, which I try to clean up with the floor towel, but he complains because the floor towel is wet.<br /> <br /> I'm low on my pain meds, and I don't know if I can just get more from the ER so I'm trying my damndest now to see if I can finish up the rest of my healing without them. Its just I get terrified at night because if its a cold night I struggle just to endure it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T11:33:55-08:00","id":25910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25840#post25840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's just in my experience everyone resents me for any sort of help they give me, and money is scary, as in my experience my family would die through neglect if they could do it in a way that there is no splashback. I'm not someone important, I'm not a child in danger[...]I was taught to be ashamed for asking for help, or try to get help from the government.</div> </div> </div> </div>I disagree with everything in this paragraph, but since I have no method to offer you support without your cooperation, my opinion here doesn't mean much.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=25840#post25840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Everyone's going through harsh times so you shouldn't feel bad that you can't help someone you know on the internet.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't. I feel bad that you think you shouldn't be helped.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T12:39:38-08:00","id":25964,"title":"","content":"You are right. I'm doing a double standard. I would be horrified if another was in this situation and I would feel they should be helped. I'm just scared and a little maladjusted. Like if I can't fix this I don't deserve to be fixed, but that is wrong. I am trying to get aid from the government right now because I genuinely need it, but everything is so difficult alone. Everyone else I know who got aid kind of had support enough to do so.<br /> <br /> I know I'm messed up and I have too much self loathing, it waxes especially when I hit rock bottom. I loose connections with good friends because when things are low it feels like I'm a black hole that will just bring everyone down if I update them on my situation.<br /> <br /> I'm just scared and lost. Today I'm hoping I can go the day and sleep without the pain meds as I only have a few left. Tomorrow with the start of the Week I should I hope feel well enough to walk better and continue making calls. And I hope the space heater my brother sent in the mail can get here soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T19:31:00-08:00","id":26223,"title":"","content":"I hope things get better for you. That's all I can think to say.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T19:07:43-08:00","id":27692,"title":"","content":"Oh hon. That's just... freaking awful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T10:24:14-08:00","id":28080,"title":"","content":"God I just wish I had a healing factor. Basic constant healing enough to walk around without being queasy/pain crippled just takes to long. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Its hard not to move your torso all day, stay warm, and go to sleep without moving. It seems to help to elevate my lower body but its hard to do that in the basement, particularly when maximizing heat.<br /> <br /> I really wish Exalted Medicine charms existed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T11:35:35-08:00","id":28144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=28080#post28080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">God I just wish I had a healing factor. Basic constant healing enough to walk around without being queasy/pain crippled just takes to long. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Its hard not to move your torso all day, stay warm, and go to sleep without moving. It seems to help to elevate my lower body but its hard to do that in the basement, particularly when maximizing heat.<br /> <br /> I really wish Exalted Medicine charms existed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Have you tried using some towels warmed from beside a fire/a dryer to switch around now and then before they turn cold?<br /> <br /> Also, at one point I was still trying to get used to the cold in this country when I was absolutely frozen from head to toe and unable to move even bundled in a couple sets of clothes and jackets with a couple of blankets on me ( who knew a Southern trying to get used to a very cold climate would be so hard... ).. The hubby got some plastic soda bottles he could find to put some hot water in to put under the blankets while I slept ( I also tend to fall back on that sometimes when I have awful cramps ).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:59:26-08:00","id":28283,"title":"","content":"I've tried using boiling water on towels and wrapping them in plastic bags, but there was too much leaking. And I used to use hot water in plastic bottles but the plastic would warp and leak, but Soda bottles might be stronger since I was only trying water bottles. A lot of it is difficult because it requires regularly moving to refill/reheat and I'm the only one handling my situation so I'm not trying to move. I need to rest with some sort of lump providing support for my lower legs/groin area so that my sensitive bits are jostled or stretched taut by gravity, and raising my hips a bit also reduces the swelling.<br /> <br /> But I learned inventive use of Hot water can be key to accessing heat, as boiling water is often the simplest method of generating heat when you don't have fire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T16:09:02-08:00","id":28362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=28283#post28283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've tried using boiling water on towels and wrapping them in plastic bags, but there was too much leaking. And I used to use hot water in plastic bottles but the plastic would warp and leak, but Soda bottles might be stronger since I was only trying water bottles. A lot of it is difficult because it requires regularly moving to refill/reheat and I'm the only one handling my situation so I'm not trying to move. I need to rest with some sort of lump providing support for my lower legs/groin area so that my sensitive bits are jostled or stretched taut by gravity, and raising my hips a bit also reduces the swelling.<br /> <br /> But I learned inventive use of Hot water can be key to accessing heat, as boiling water is often the simplest method of generating heat when you don't have fire.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can confirm that soda bottles work. I drink diet ice tea made from powder and hot water(yes yes mock me if you will) and I have the hot water heater set to produce water at maximum temperature. I use the 2 liter bottles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T16:13:36-08:00","id":28363,"title":"","content":"Hmmm this is an innovation then! Before I didn't drink soda so I didn't have access to soda bottles when I lived on my own, now I live in a house where everyone goes through an insanely unhealthy amount of soda Consumption so I can collect two bottles boil some water, pour it in (hopefully I can find my funnel) and have it last me for a while! As I need to warm my feet particularly this will be very beneficial for me!<br /> <br /> Thanks guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T14:16:38-08:00","id":29516,"title":"","content":"I also used a rice sock when I was having really bad pain in my neck. You can buy them, but you can also make it yourself. Get a long sock, fill it with plain rice (not minute rice) and knot or sew up the sock. You heat it up in the microwave for 2-3 minutes. You can use them anywhere you need some heat and apparently you can use corn instead of rice if you need to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1285,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1285-xaria","user":"Xaria","date":".  Used the wrong word, didn't see it until after I pushed post. 12-13-2013, 05:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1285-xaria","name":"Xaria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T15:50:06-08:00","id":29584,"title":"","content":"As I am on SSI (bipolar and numerous other disorders), this is what I recommend.<br /> <br /> 1. Get in touch of a doctor who can treat you NOW. Sign a medical release form and give him/her a list of your former doctors so they can get a hold of your records.<br /> 2. Find a lawyer that specializes in disability cases. Social Security has an 85% rejection rate on the first application. Mom and Dad were exceptions, getting their SSI at first go around. I had to go through 2 appeals and that took me over 2 years before I was finally accepted. The lawyer will work for a fee, usually a percentage of what you will receive which SS will pay and expenses. I only had to pay over $200 for final expenses.<br /> 3. See the doctor whenever you get sick so it can be recorded. This is how Medicare realized I had fibromyalgia as well and paid for several treatments (chiropractor, nerve burning, possible back brace). I already got a leg brace for when the left leg acts up.<br /> 4. DON'T GIVE UP! You got friends here and if you need to vent, go for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T06:05:04-08:00","id":29859,"title":"","content":"That rice sock is a brilliant idea!<br /> <br /> <br /> Jaded thank you very much for the advice, that is the type of advice I really need as I've never done this before. I'm trying to find doctors, but as I had no money or insurance its been halted, but I'll keep trying. What I need is a primary care Doctor to manage my over all situation and a Muscle Skeletal doctor, they referred me to a Urologist but they were not helpful (she didn't listen to anything I said) and want to give a cystoscopy which in my condition and in this environment I'm terrified of it mutilating me further with them not even getting useful information from it.<br /> <br /> I've contacted two SSI lawyers one in the state I'm in and one in Michigan where I used to live. I didn't know about multiple Appeals would you care to explain how that works did you use the same lawyer and just provide more information?<br /> <br /> Getting to a doctor every time I'm having issues has been difficult in general as I essentially have to beg for a ride, and they give me dirty looks any time I'm above ground. And the ER here sucks, part of why I'm recovering now is because my condition got worse by going to the crappy ER where they didn't have bleepen hot water and wouldn't listen when I was saying my condition was going out of wack because I was cold.<br /> <br /> <br /> I heal up from the sleeping but after being awake for a few hours everything starts deteriorating again. But at least these last two days I don't feel sick the first few hours after I wake up.<br /> <br /> <br /> And people have been kind on the forums. Three people have reached out to brighten my day in with PMs. My faith in humanity is being rekindled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T02:31:25-08:00","id":30860,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. I have an entirely different condition, but if you can't go to the doctors, making a log of the issues and the times and conditions under which they occur will help when you can see a doctor; it'll back up what you're saying because you can point out all of the factors you know about. If relevant, take photos.<br /> <br /> I know documenting misery sucks, but at least you'll have a resource for the doctor as well.<br /> <br /> [I have a couple of conditions where recording when it was happening was a big part of the diagnosis, that's why I even know about doing that.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://tludoesart.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">Check out my art here!</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Mu-Kbt6birt-A0ODsNbqabRC0PRG5brJtKl48DUou7c/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">You can see my stuff from the old forum here.</a><br /> Two Exalted Bound In Chains of the Sun","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/35-tluthal","name":"tluthal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar35_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T05:23:33-08:00","id":30913,"title":"","content":"I filed for the SSI on my own at first, with the Mental Health Mental Retardation (MHMR) helping me out when I was living in Austin. When I got rejected the first time, Bo (Elisabeth's dad) handed me a card to a guy who specialized in the field (Bo was getting upset at my mood swings and the different medicine which were not working out). Bo deals with the transportation of disabled people daily so I took his advice and the guy worked with me, dealing with my bipolar, the constant moving about (I was even hospitalized in Tennessee where we FINALLY got the right drug mixture). My current regular doctor tried to get me a gastric bypass surgery because I am morbidly obese (mainly top heavy) but Medicare rejected that...I was not too upset because I was scared of having the procedure done.<br /> <br /> Fast forward...got my okay from the judge in 8/2009, payments started a couple of months later with backpay...paid off the bills from Tennessee, helped my brother out some, got me a kick-ass computer for less than $600, got satellite broadband and MHMR declared that I don't have to pay for any bills since being on Medicare means they pay for it. COLA (cost of living adjustment) is kicking in on the 1st, I am paying my student loans back and with careful budgeting, I am saving up money (unless there is a WOD book on special...) and I get to play Runescape, depending on which package I want (the gold one is $88...up from $75 last year). I also play Club Pogo...if I can get my Mom off of it...she has become a badge addict.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T12:22:13-08:00","id":31113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JadedTrueBrujah</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=29584#post29584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1. Get in touch of a doctor who can treat you NOW. Sign a medical release form and give him/her a list of your former doctors so they can get a hold of your records.</div> </div> </div> </div>No doctors are willing to see me because I have no health insurance and zero money. I only got to see the Urologist because they realized when they turned me away it was illegal. And the Urologist wasn't even paying attention to what I was telling her, she wants to give me a cystoscopy and I'm terrified they will just mutilate me again and find nothing, my old doctors had me stop going to a Urologist because I have a muscle skeleton problem. God I hate it! No doctors will see you without Effin MONEY OR INSURANCE!<br /> <br /> I've healed up enough at least to walk around some.<br /> <br /> My Cats mouth was bleeding today from the wound on her upper lip. I wish I knew did that to her, and it better not have been intentional.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T12:32:18-08:00","id":31124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tluthal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=30860#post30860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm. I have an entirely different condition, but if you can't go to the doctors, making a log of the issues and the times and conditions under which they occur will help when you can see a doctor; it'll back up what you're saying because you can point out all of the factors you know about. If relevant, take photos.<br /> <br /> I know documenting misery sucks, but at least you'll have a resource for the doctor as well.<br /> <br /> [I have a couple of conditions where recording when it was happening was a big part of the diagnosis, that's why I even know about doing that.]</div> </div> </div> </div>I can try this but no seems to even care. I've only collected so much information about whats wrong with me because of the fact I had to make observations and collect notes myself. God I can't handle this process. If I could at least make it back to where I lived in Michigan at least I had this awesome free clinic to last me, but I would have no where to live.<br /> <br /> I just got a space heater from my brother in Texas a few minutes ago. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> God I just want to be normal and Healthy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T03:39:32-08:00","id":35491,"title":"","content":"You are in NC? I live just south of you in SC. I can offer my help navigating the &quot;system&quot;,it's a knack I'm good at. If you want, PM me and let me know what NC depts. you need to deal with, or if you aren't sure, what the specific issues are and I can find them and help give you specific links to help you cut through a lot of the bs and unnecessary info on the sites.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1511-vonkarolinas","name":"vonkarolinas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T13:35:19-08:00","id":35776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vonkarolinas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=35491#post35491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are in NC? I live just south of you in SC. I can offer my help navigating the &quot;system&quot;,it's a knack I'm good at. If you want, PM me and let me know what NC depts. you need to deal with, or if you aren't sure, what the specific issues are and I can find them and help give you specific links to help you cut through a lot of the bs and unnecessary info on the sites.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay it won't allow me to send bleepen messages for some reason so I'll post here till that part of the forums gets fixed. It says My message quota is filled up past 100, but I only sent like 4 messages total.<br /> <br /> Well I'm trying to get a Bridge Card and Medicaid through Social Services building and its past like 3 months they keep saying they forgot about me when I call them, I should have gotten the Bridge card by now at least even if they would still be investigating the Medicaid thing.<br /> <br /> I'm also trying to get SSI through the SSI office and again its been past 3 months and they haven't contacted me in a month since I went to the Doctors they wanted me to get checked by.<br /> <br /> I think I found how to get glasses though nearby.<br /> <br /> Everything is taking tooo long, and they keep losing me in the system!<br /> <br /> \u200bI would very much appreciate any advice. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T16:48:13-08:00","id":35915,"title":"","content":"I reported your problem with PMs, Eldagusto.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-28T21:47:05-08:00","id":38582,"title":"","content":"I got my Bridge card at least, so now I can have Vegetables and Fruits for the first time in half a year...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T04:08:33-08:00","id":38670,"title":"","content":"That's good. I just got word that my Medicare part D is taking my Artane off of the formulary. I need that for my shakes. Now for someone to pop my upper back...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T05:19:39-08:00","id":38684,"title":"","content":"Also...get ready for dirty looks but you might have to go to your local Social Security office and 'gently' remind them who you are....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T11:59:45-08:00","id":39518,"title":"","content":"My god I just got two months of my most crucial Medicine, and warm clothes from a friend, cat food and liter, and actual fruits, vegetables, and candy! I'm so greatful today, it was getting harsh without this medicine. With it I should hopefully keep the worst of my symptoms at bay. And now I can cook a healthy and delicious multicourse meal for my Nieces!<br /> <br /> Oh and eldest daughter of the my brothers Fiancee seems to think I'm some smelly hobo, and really seems to resent me leaving my hobo pit...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> My social Security Office is pretty flippant with excusing you if you don't have an appointment, and even making an appointment hmm maybe I need to do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T15:01:02-08:00","id":39616,"title":"","content":"My regular doctor canceled Mom's and I's appointments for Friday and dropped a few hints that something happen to him. I have been checking FB for word from his wife. It looks like we have to switch doctors and probably find pain management ones. I had the pharmacy fax my old doctor to get my thyroid and simvastatin meds. Mom made appointments with a former doctor of mine from years ago for next week. I hope he can prescribe my Norco and tramadol or refer me to a pain specialist...waking up with back pain is not fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T10:13:46-08:00","id":41807,"title":"","content":"Okay so I think I was denied Medicaid but I haven't received the Letter yet, I'm trying to get in touch with the Caseworker who denied me.<br /> <br /> I finally got ahold of the SSI office, its so messed up that the only time that I was not automatically hanged up for high call numbers was at lunch time. They said they are still processing... and there is no way I can expedite that.<br /> <br /> Good news is I got a letter from a friend/Ex Roommate and he sent me money to ensure I can get medicine and cat food, and maybe even a clinic appointment since before I didn't have the money for even the reduced price at 25 bucks.<br /> <br /> And I may be moving into the actual house later this month. Apparently my Brother's fiancee is moving out, back to Michigan with her kid after another argument. This is a mixed issue, but on the bright side I will get a warm room and I can use the basement to store my possessions.<br /> <br /> I also got ahold of the Urologist and apparently I only saw the Nurse last time, who gave the impression she was the doctor. So instead of getting a Cystoscopy which I protested because I felt I wouldn't be able to get it without injury, I am now going to just see the actual doctor.<br /> <br /> <br /> And with getting foodstamps I was able to convince my nieces to eat fruits and vegetables instead of just damned poptarts and sugar cereal. Though they are really fighting it. I never realized that it was actually this hard to get kids to eat healthy... I just thought it was media exaggeration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T11:42:14-08:00","id":41851,"title":"","content":"Saw the new doctor...no pain pills but I will get my simvastitin and thyroid medicine tomorrow. I have to get a referral for pain pills and that means pain management located over 50 miles away. Having fibromyalgia during the cold is not making me happy.<br /> <br /> I am headed back to bed. it is basically the only place I can stay warm.<br /> <br /> Grocery shopping is delayed until tomorrow morning...in the freezing cold...at least there is no snow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T11:56:35-08:00","id":41857,"title":"","content":"Aye I feel your pain. If I can get to sleep before 7 or so I will be able to enter my healing slumber, anytime past that and it might be difficult for me to get to sleep cause of the cold. But if I can get to sleep and not get waken up I can super sleep and therefore heal since I stay warm and unmoving while sleeping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T17:32:56-08:00","id":42054,"title":"","content":"Laid down for a nap and suddenly starting cramping. Took care of that but I was so weak afterwards, I dragged myself back to bed. Elisabeth calls me at 4, wanting to know if I mailed off her present from my brother. Went back to bed and got up about 5:30. I am chilled, dealing with this cold front, wanting to bundle up. She wants new pegs for her violin and I told her I cannot afford them at this time (I already got her earrings for her birthday in February).<br /> <br /> Stamps are going up again this month so I bought 2 books of forever stamps. Went ahead and got my 6-month membership for Runescape. Grocery shopping is tomorrow because I get the discounted meats before the store gets crowded.<br /> <br /> Saw the new doctor and she ordered my simvastitin and thyroid meds. wants me back on the 24th to do bloodwork for my MHMR NP (it's time to check my drug levels). At that time, I will ask for pain pills and get the referral for the pain management.<br /> <br /> We had a flat the other day so my brother changed it. We took the bad tire in to get fixed and the guy did not charge us. I think he has a crush on Mom...LOL! He was even able to put the spare back in the tire holder so we will have room for groceries tomorrow!<br /> <br /> I wish Mom stop messing with the heater...Texas is being hit with this cold as well. I got my heavy coat kinda hanging over the vent so it would be warm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T03:51:05-08:00","id":42205,"title":"","content":"Wow that's a nice guy if he fixed the Tire for free. Must be flattering for your mom to have admirers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T09:17:51-08:00","id":42316,"title":"","content":"We are steady customers...there is an other guy in another town with a tow truck. I got him on my cell phone in case we break down. One day we had another flat (roofer's nail), got my SIL call him up and he called me, asking for directions. He came by, got the tire and return it fixed and did not charge us until the next day. He is the guy we go to when the van acts funny, needs an oil change or needs wipers. During an oil change, he discovered that our windshield wiper fluid tank had a crack in it and replaced it. If she gets a boyfriend though...I will object. She has to take care of me as I take care of her.<br /> <br /> I told Mom I will throw a tantrum at the MHMR office about my Artane being off of the formulary list by Medicare part D. I need it because Geodon has a side effect of the shakes. My leg is usually shaking if I don't take the medicine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T09:26:40-08:00","id":44230,"title":"","content":"So I just got back, convinced the Urologist not to mutilate me, and he says I need to just get a primary Care Doctor, and a Muscle Rehab doctor... but hard to find any physician that will give me a break for not having income or insurance. Meanwhile my ass brother doesn't realize its insulting to outright mock my health and the idea of me being crippled just to make a joke with someone he says he doesn't like. I seriously can't stand this. Really prickish behavior to make fun of someones ill health because they perceive no repercussions for doing so. I can't stand his sycophantic behavior, and how it switches from sycophantic to borderline sociopathy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T17:01:09-08:00","id":44544,"title":"","content":"Is there a free clinic around there? We are having one built here (used to be in Winfield, 10 miles away from the main town) and I am going see if they accept Medicare/Medicaid patients who need pain killers without having to go over 50 miles away for pain management.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T21:20:21-08:00","id":44651,"title":"","content":"From my understanding the only free Clinic Around here just closed like this month.<br /> <br /> And I went to my Urologist and convinced them not to mutilate me, he said it wouldn't have provided the info they needed anyways and pretty much told me to get a muscle rehab doctor and a Primary care doctor....<br /> <br /> <br /> Oh and then everything exploded back at the house when I witnessed my first police visit due to domestic abuse... Now I'm just hoping my brother doesn't have it in for me because I was friggin trying to keep the 10 year old from Crying while he screams at her mom the Ex Fiancee, punches the Fiancee's kid, and then proceeds to tell the 10 year old that the man who she thought was her biological dad for her whole life isn't her biological dad....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T21:24:41-08:00","id":44658,"title":"","content":"jesus man. I don't pray or anything but you have my sympathies and I'll keep you in my thoughts. Wish there was something I could do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T22:48:55-08:00","id":44700,"title":"","content":"Damn. Shit sucks, bro. I hope that things start changing for the better, bro. Have you considered attending a local church? They're usually pretty good about helping those who need it; if you tell the pastor everything you've told us I'm sure he'll do what he can to help you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1878-adamantinerapier","name":"AdamantineRapier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1878_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T02:40:14-08:00","id":44782,"title":"","content":"I don't know any of the local churches, but my best friend back in MI says he talks about my problems with his church group. I don't really have experience with that.<br /> <br /> And now my pointing finger on my left hand is swelling. I just got back down stairs after waking up and having to take an emergency hot bath due to a medical flare up and my smallest cat sat on my throat and when moving her to the her healing flea bites acted up and she bit me trying to bite her itchy flea bite. Poored hot water and rubbing alcohol on it, and took ibuprofen, and the swelling and bleeding is going down. Damnit the little usually never hurts me unless I give her a bath, but move her less then a foot while shes trying to scratch an itch and my finger is swollen.<br /> <br /> God in theory I should be able to move into the house tomorrow when the others move out, and I can finally sleep somewhere that isn't a cold basement of a garage, but after finding out my damn brother has hit his fiancee, and before has broken the jaw of his previous wife, who I just found out he is still technically married to, I am sickened. I moved here from TN to get away from a friend who was acting crazy with his wife and I find this is the situation I'm in! You don't hit women, and you don't talk like that in front of a Ten year old. Just because your my brother doesn't mean I'll back this crap. As soon as I can I need to get out of here.<br /> <br /> My brother is like 16 years older then me. He doesn't listen to anyone, and he does a crazy amount of mental gymnastics to perceive himself as a good guy. I have no idea how stable he's going to be over the next couple weeks or even couple days. His ex Fiancee was the one who cleaned and did his Laundry, and if I'm the only one living with him, and his personality is to scapegoat all his problems onto others...<br /> <br /> My friend in Michigan is trying to figure out if there is someway I can get on HUD housing to see if I can get back to Michigan. Its too unstable here.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T05:00:20-08:00","id":44826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=44782#post44782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know any of the local churches, but my best friend back in MI says he talks about my problems with his church group. I don't really have experience with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're in the Deep South. There's going to be a church nearby; just google &quot;town name church&quot; and you should be able to find one (or more) near you, and odds are they'll have a phone number you can call. Tell them you would come in on Sunday and ask in person, but, well, crippling physical disability.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And now my pointing finger on my left hand is swelling. I just got back down stairs after waking up and having to take an emergency hot bath due to a medical flare up and my smallest cat sat on my throat and when moving her to the her healing flea bites acted up and she bit me trying to bite her itchy flea bite. Poored hot water and rubbing alcohol on it, and took ibuprofen, and the swelling and bleeding is going down. Damnit the little usually never hurts me unless I give her a bath, but move her less then a foot while shes trying to scratch an itch and my finger is swollen. </div> </div> </div>Poor cat. I hope you're able to get help from someone who actually gives a shit soon,<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> God in theory I should be able to move into the house tomorrow when the others move out, and I can finally sleep somewhere that isn't a cold basement of a garage, but after finding out my damn brother has hit his fiancee, and before has broken the jaw of his previous wife, who I just found out he is still technically married to, I am sickened. I moved here from TN to get away from a friend who was acting crazy with his wife and I find this is the situation I'm in! You don't hit women, and you don't talk like that in front of a Ten year old. Just because your my brother doesn't mean I'll back this crap. As soon as I can I need to get out of here. </div> </div> </div>Well, this is one of the reasons I'd recommend trying to talk to a church. I remember when I was a child, my family took in a a few people with nowhere else to go. With any luck, you'll be able to find a Christian family who will be willing to give you a place to stay while you heal and try to get back on your feet (both literally and figuratively). I don't know what your religion is, but even if you're not a Christian, it's bound to be better than living with your abusive psychopath of a brother, at least as long as you're not an Dawkins-style asshole atheist or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1878-adamantinerapier","name":"AdamantineRapier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1878_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-08T08:29:06-08:00","id":44928,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the advice, its an option I didn't think of and I'll look into it, at the very least it will be a back up. I've heard of churches helping people out down on their luck, I thought they just let some people like live in the back rooms of the church or something when people get their houses burned down or something.<br /> <br /> I'm not setting off my brother at the moment, my cats and all my possessions, including a few momentos from my deceased dad are on his property. If it came down to it I would leave with the cats if I had to in a heartbeat. But I can hopefully keep things calm and at least stay the winter without having to bother some nice church family. Moving out to live with strangers in the same town would send him over the deep end.<br /> <br /> The big move of the ex Fiancee's is happening to I snuck some snacks for them with her kid. I think my brother is calming down now since they are about to leave today. I will put my bed upstairs and finally have a closet and drawers to hang my clothes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T17:51:06-08:00","id":45944,"title":"","content":"I live in a 2 bedroom trailer with my Mom, making her the head of the household. I do get SNAP, which I use on salads and meats (and an occasional Diet MD). I give her $200 rent as a backup (urgent bills like this last flat that caused her to spend $90 for a new tire). I pay on my student loans, internet, life insurance, Medicare part D, Elisabeth's cell phone and my eBay habit (this time I got 5 books, 4 for mom to read). The co-pay for my drugs depends on what I get at the first and middle of the month. I have my own cell phone, just a basic Tracfone that I pay online at a cheaper rate (I got over 1500 minutes and it is seldom used except for emergencies or if I am out of town or if Mom goes to Arkansas). I just paid for a 6-month membership for Runescape and reserved my room for Anime Overload in Austin (Elisabeth is designing a new cosplay).<br /> <br /> I try my best to help keep the house clean but I have 5 bookshelves in my room with my CDs, DVDs, and books. I also collect certain comic books and crochet patterns. I got at least 6 bins of yarn in the storage hut (my grandma attached this to an old travel trailer that I had, giving her a private place to live in while she was alive) and a few more books. Today I was washing dishes (dishwasher leaks) and my lower back starts hurting (as usual). Told Mom I was going to take a Norco afterwards so I can be relaxed. We are thinking of getting a contractor to come out, remove the dishwasher and build a shelf or two in there with a door to store the contact cooker, slow cooker and electric stew pot in it.<br /> <br /> Mom laid Myia (my 5yo niece) just before 7 and she was out like a light within 3 minutes. She does not do naps. I was on the phone with Elisabeth just now, just jabbering away, making plans for Anime Overload (she is working on her cosplay costume). She has been up since 3 this morning, apparently having an attack of insomnia...that is what tumbler is for! She is seeing the doctor about it on Tuesday, I got my caseworker on Tuesday afternoon and Mom has a mammogram Tuesday morning. <br /> <br /> We really don't have pets. Our neighbor has a beautiful Aussie bitch that comes over to check up on us and I will feed her scraps, especially if she is nursing. People dropped off some cats that are a bit feral but are demanding when they are hungry. Mom caught one eating out of the bird feeder. Before the polar vortex attack, we had 4 kittens and the kids were chasing them around, with me and Donna, Myia's mom, sexing them (3 girls, 1 boy). Momma kitty has them hidden again, probably in the big shed.<br /> <br /> Tomorrow is Principal's Day at the kids school, where they give out awards to the kids who do extremely well in several areas. My digital camera is dead so I grabbed the disposable camera with 6 pics left in it. I am buying me a battery charger and batteries next month!<br /> <br /> Today was a sociopathic type of day for me...dealing with Myia who wanted a picture of the Headless Horseman. I fear she is too much like me...she asked me what a clan was and I told her a family (we got Scots and Irish blood in our background as well as Osage blood) so now she has figured out I am doing work on an evil family. I was reading up on the Baali...LOL!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T10:49:20-08:00","id":48313,"title":"","content":"God I don't know what to do! I finally got my SSI dismissal letter, and I was denied for medicaid but didn't get a letter. My lawyer says they won't do a case without me having seen a doctor for 6 months/a year steadily. I couldn't get a doctor since I left michigan 6 months ago! I called and before previously two clinics told me before that I could get in with 45 dollars and the other 50 dollars because of my situation but I called again and the other receptionists deny this and call me a liar! I need paper work to get into one possibly for 20 dollars but I need to get paperwork from the Social Worker Building and the SSI office, and a notarized letter from my brother saying he's not supporting me and another noterized letter from someone saying they aren't supporting me but they will help out one time, but the only person that helped me lives in another state.<br /> <br /> I don't know what to do! I waited friggin four months for just being denied and only now are they saying I need a regular doctor! I didn't have money or even a stable place to live! I'm depressed and scared, the only plan I can even think of now is getting back to michigan, but to get housing I need to wait six months! And if I were to try to get SSI again I would probably have to wait again! GOD if I knew about any of this stuff I could of applied for the house Voucher when I left michigan 6 months ago and returned by now!<br /> <br /> I CAN'T STAND IT! I need a to see doctors! But In order to get help with Medical visits I need to have already been seeing Doctors! That doesn't make sense! With no money or support I'm completely cut off from the damn system! I have to be able to Afford Medical attention in order to even be given assistance for Medical Attention! I've been Bed Ridden for 4 Months and it means CRAP because I couldn't go to any doctor Besides an ER!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T13:38:09-08:00","id":48444,"title":"","content":"Finally got the word...our old doctor had another stroke and he is in Longview now doing rehab. This new doctor does not do narcotics so we will get a pain management doctor about 50 miles away...either Longview, Tyler or Paris. I am cramping up a little today and I receive a bill from the old doctor...Medicare and Medicaid is suppose to take care of this mess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T13:56:05-08:00","id":48453,"title":"","content":"I want to chime in with support but thats all it is. Words of support. I can't do anything for you unfortunately but I feel terrible you are having to go through this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T15:16:13-08:00","id":48512,"title":"","content":"I hate this system isn't there anyway I can become Canadian?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T15:56:50-08:00","id":48537,"title":"","content":"I tried...unless you have a degree in something great, no way in. I was wanting to join a girlfriend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T19:09:29-08:00","id":48650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=48512#post48512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hate this system isn't there anyway I can become Canadian?</div> </div> </div> </div>Good news bad news. On the one hand, Canada is fairly welcoming to immigration in general. On the other, if you're just up and relocating you generally need a job offer or to meet the skilled worker qualification (this comes down to a degree or significant experience, and it's a bonus if you speak french and a lesser bonus if you speak other languages) <br /> <br /> As an american, it's actually easier for you to get temporary work visas up there. If you do pretty much anything in the technical or medical fields it's little more than getting a job offer and filling out a visa application at the border and paying a few fees.<br /> <br /> You can also take the marriage route. That would require you to be in a relationship and marry a man, woman or misc.other from Canada.<br /> <br /> However, one of the catches with all these routes is that Canada has been clamping down the last few years on people that move in specifically to cash in on social services. It's overblown and more than a bit of a dick move, but from what I've read what will often happen is that immigrants are either denied if they have significant health concerns, or in the cases where denial is difficult (such as marriage) they make the person doing the sponsoring legally responsible for any government assistance that person might claim in the next several years.<br /> <br /> <br /> That having been said, and taking with it the grain of salt that I'm talking about numbers/situations from a decade ago, outside of the invisible amount paid on my taxes, I was paying about $80/month as an independent contractor (business above a certain size are mandated to to cover insurance costs)... IIRC that was providing me with a plan that covered new glasses every couple years, 80% of the prescription costs and the majority of the costs of dental care. So the actual health care costs out of pocket for people up there are reasonable.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T23:13:26-08:00","id":48756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=35776#post35776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay it won't allow me to send bleepen messages for some reason so I'll post here till that part of the forums gets fixed. It says My message quota is filled up past 100, but I only sent like 4 messages total.<br /> <br /> Well I'm trying to get a Bridge Card and Medicaid through Social Services building and its past like 3 months they keep saying they forgot about me when I call them, I should have gotten the Bridge card by now at least even if they would still be investigating the Medicaid thing.<br /> <br /> I'm also trying to get SSI through the SSI office and again its been past 3 months and they haven't contacted me in a month since I went to the Doctors they wanted me to get checked by.<br /> <br /> I think I found how to get glasses though nearby.<br /> <br /> Everything is taking tooo long, and they keep losing me in the system!<br /> <br /> \u200bI would very much appreciate any advice. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Let me know if you have access to your inbox. I just sent you a PM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1511-vonkarolinas","name":"vonkarolinas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T09:20:14-08:00","id":49033,"title":"","content":"It didn't seem to register on my Inbox. Still having troubles with the Inbox. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T16:23:57-08:00","id":51151,"title":"","content":"I am on strike against all cold fronts...all they do is make me tired and sleep for more then 12 hours. Of course taking cherry nyquil along with all my pills might have something to do with it (I hate colds).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T15:43:53-08:00","id":52813,"title":"","content":"Checking up on you. Hope nothing bad happen and you are warm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T00:00:49-08:00","id":53052,"title":"","content":"I managed to move into a room into the house, and I'm trying to heal up because I think if I can I keep from having a major episode. But I have to clean the basement so my plan to not move around till I'm healed is a bit hampered. My friend mailed me thermal socks and a electric pad so I can heat my feet. I've been using my spaceheater on the sly so that also aids in being warm for the first time in a long time.<br /> <br /> My brother is Moving to Pennsylvania for a job, and that seems like a miracle because I'm constantly trying to avoid him so I don't set him off. He is letting his ex Fiancee's son move into the basement... this is suspicious because this is the kid he punched and said he doesn't trust, he claims he is letting him move in so he can help me with rides... but I'm not buying that.<br /> <br /> But since I seem to have no way to get medical attention here, I'm trying to move back to Michigan. My friend is tryiing to see if he can sign me up for low income housing by proxy, and his bible study group member is trying to help him get in touch with a social worker to help me.<br /> <br /> Its much better then the basement. I'm worried though because I haven't healed up, I'm hoping I'll feel better with say another week, but I'm worried because this winter I was essentially constantly having episodes without healing, normally when I lived with myself I was able to heal by resting and trying to keep warm and I'm only just now able to do it but everything hurts by nighttime.<br /> <br /> And I feel muscles and things that should be inside my body poking out, that's why I'm scared something is herniated.<br /> <br /> But I had a brief fight with my brother today because he only now just noticed that my cat chopper has patches of fur that is bald, and that she is scrawny, and I got angry because its been like that for months! She's actually finally growing her fur back because I got her a flea collar, and she's scrawny because the half feral cats he keeps in the house but says aren't his are attacking her all the time and stealing her food! But I've been bringing Chopper into my room because she's been crying since I moved out of the basement and she misses me.<br /> <br /> But in two weeks if my Brother doesn't do something Crazy he will be moving out of the house and I can have some place quite and calm to heal up and last the winter while I try to get back to Michigan and see regular doctors.<br /> <br /> My sanity has been saved by my friend in Michigan who I vent to. He's was going to go back to MIT this Month but he changed the date to Sept so if I'm lucky I'll be able to get back to Michigan and spend time with him before he goes back. I desperately miss spending time with my friends.<br /> <br /> But I also babysitted my Nieces today, they seem to have taken the fact that their almost sister in law, and the rest of the household that my brother chased away, left for Michigan.<br /> <br /> Oh and my brother is literally going on a date every day while still complaining that he misses his fiancee! His kinda Ex Wife even told him he didn't really love her if was fine with going out immediately after she left, and I do mean immediately as in like the day of. He's antsy and desperate, and even trying to do things like go to churches to hit on women, even though I know his opinion about religion.<br /> <br /> But I am warm. Before I was feeling horrible pains around nightfall, but the last two days I've managed to delay feeling pains till about midnight or so, so I'm hoping if I can keep this up I can heal up enough to not spasm in a day. That and I hope my friggin muscles will return to their proper place within my body rather then bulging out and what have you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T17:25:27-08:00","id":53573,"title":"","content":"I can't take it, everyday is just fear pain anger and depression.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T17:42:42-08:00","id":53591,"title":"","content":"I am here...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T23:22:59-08:00","id":55280,"title":"","content":"I figured I would check in. Its nice to hear that things might be taking a turn for the better, even though it was getting rougher before that. I hope you have even better news soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/536-divinewrath","name":"DivineWrath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T16:04:33-08:00","id":55775,"title":"","content":"back spasms today. Went to the doctor who is leaving us after 2 weeks of accepting us and had our medical records transferred. I did pick up some dark chocolate so I can have my weekly munchie for a while. Good news...Walmart got 4 new motorized shopping carts after my constant complaining about the lack of them and the ones they have not being fully charged. This town has a large elderly population, some of which are crippled and need those carts. I only use them about twice a month when I am getting my groceries and am stiff from the cold and back pains. <br /> <br /> Almost fell out of bed this morning. Caught myself on my dresser...which reminds me I need to straighten it up....books and personal things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T16:11:43-08:00","id":59241,"title":"","content":"God I just spent the whole damn day at the ER, apparently why I've been falling apart even though I moved in doors is because I've friggin have not only a urinary tract infection but prostitis and I had to use money from a friend just to get antibiotics because my sociopath brother knows that helping me with medicine means missing a few steak dinners.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T17:27:20-08:00","id":59302,"title":"","content":"Could not get on here until I finished something up for my brother...<br /> <br /> Maybe a nice little hex? A bout of gout for your brother? The Goddess knows I am dealing with my gout (in my knee) and I am suppose to wear a knee brace but it moves around too much for me.<br /> <br /> Follow the directions for the antibiotics and take care. I will light a candle to help out.<br /> <br /> Usual fee is candy, preferably peanut M&amp;Ms...<br /> <br /> Battening down the hatches for this cold front...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T09:01:48-08:00","id":59861,"title":"","content":"Jesus Christ the urologist said Rey misdiagnosed me and I don't have a urinary tract infection so I paid half of all the money I had in the world for nothing! The damned ER here is so Fing incompetent! Go I'm exhausted because everyone keeps waking me up. Everything hurts, I need competent medical care! God how can I just lose 150 bucks because the incompetent ER orders me to get medicine that it turns out I don't need. Jesus Christ this is money I could have used to get actual medical care or medicines I damn we'll needed! They shafted me and there is nothing I can do!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T09:15:52-08:00","id":59878,"title":"","content":"Sounds like the ER is committing fraud just to get money...I have been dealing with a problem hip for years and all they do is give me x-rays and to go to my doctor who gives me pain killers. I need a steroid shot NOW!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T09:32:31-08:00","id":59894,"title":"","content":"Damn dude. I haven't read this whole thread, but from what I've read it sounds to me like your family isn't acting much like family. Have any really good friends that'd be willing to take you in? Sounds like that would be better than staying with your family...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T15:38:37-08:00","id":60189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=59894#post59894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Damn dude. I haven't read this whole thread, but from what I've read it sounds to me like your family isn't acting much like family. Have any really good friends that'd be willing to take you in? Sounds like that would be better than staying with your family...</div> </div> </div> </div> My family is apathetic, or in the case of some individuals monsters, the moment I'm of no use to them they throw me away. Both my parents are deceased, and all my siblings were used to being bailed out by them. When my dad passed away my siblings even had secret meetings where they agreed to not pay the bills my dad was helping me with in exchange for dividing it up among themselves. I don't have any friends to stay with, I have two good friends helping me with this situation but they are limited in that they are young and essentially dependent on their parents. I had another friend who wanted me to live with him when he found out I was having trouble, but when he found out I had poor health he retracted his offer and prefers to ignore me when my condition is giving me exceptional difficulty. I've even had numerous friends who I've supported and even gave food and shelter too who have no interest in helping me the moment my health declined and I've reaches emergency status. I haven't been able to see any friendly face since June.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T04:30:13-08:00","id":60629,"title":"","content":"Ah, damn man. That really sucks all around. I'm sorry you're having to deal with it man. Wish I had some better advice... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:10:52-08:00","id":63358,"title":"","content":"Hey, Elda, I just wanted to say something. I don't often post in threads about other people's problems, which is likely very selfish of me, but I do follow your posts and have for quite a while.<br /> Anyway, I just want to say that you're a strong person for persevering in the situation you're in right now, medically and otherwise, and if you ever need someone to talk to or game with or whatever, I'm there.<br /> You seem like a genuinely great person, and I just wanted to let you know that I value your presence here on the forums. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:14:27-08:00","id":63359,"title":"","content":"I don't know what to do, my next step is getting my taxes handled an I should get 1k back due to me being destitute. But I don't know how I will get back to Michigan, I could probably fly there but the only place to stay would be a homeless shelter. Maybe I could try a church there. My brother should leave tomorrow. I'm so worried without a gameplan. I'm watching pursuit of happiness trying to not move so my body heals enough for me to sleep. This is a movie about hope and hitting rock bottom, it'll take my worries away for an hour and a half but after that... God I'm scared.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T05:34:13-08:00","id":63394,"title":"","content":"I really wish I had some helpful information to give you, or something vaguely helpful to say to you. Honestly, were you near to me, and I was in control of my own home, I'd gladly offer you a place to stay and recover. I've had long-term houseguests based the simple premise that I &quot;kinda knew them&quot; from &quot;a place.&quot;<br /> Should I become independent in the near future, the offer stands. At the very least, I'd have a roommate to bounce WoD story-ideas off of and gripe about the healthcare system with. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> I hope that this fear you're feeling is assuaged by some good news soon, Eldagusto. I can't imagine how stressed you must be. As I said, I'm here if you ever need to talk to someone on a more personal level than forum posts, and here in general. *holds up Fist of Solidarity*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 02-02-2014, 09:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T05:54:36-08:00","id":63400,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Thanks. I'll tell you after I don't want to live away from friendly faces. God I miss having friends, so roommates would be nice especially if it was a stable situation rather then for less then a year. My friend trying to see if he can get me two of my other essential medicines, including anxiety/depression medicine. Now I'm watching Benjamin button grow young, it's a long move Ie so if I don't move too much watching I can hopefully heal up enough to sleep for over 12 hours.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T22:05:13-08:00","id":64594,"title":"","content":"I hope you got a chance to rest and heal a bit, Eldagusto. I'm hoping your friend comes through for you with those much needed medications.<br /> <br /> \u200bAs an aside, becoming independent and fairly stable is my goal for the year. By my next birthday, I'm hoping to be driving and in my own house/apartment. I've honestly never lived on my own before, so the thought of all by myself in a house is alternatively exciting and ridiculously horrifying. I moved out once, at 18 (26 now) into a rust-bucket old AirStream trailer (those shiny metal trailers) with a few friends and moved back home within a month. Granted, the fact that we had no heating, indoor plumbing, or like, SPACE, was probably a contributing factor in my moving home.<br /> Either way, this will be the first time I live independently and FUNCTIONALLY, so that's cool. I have zero local friends at the moment, so if I want some live-in company, I'll have to either get a roommate I can be nerdy with or hope I get lucky in the romantic arena. So screwed for social interaction am I.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I hope you are feeling better and wish you an easier recovery than you've had so far.<br /> <br /> Many hugs.<br /> - Az","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 02-04-2014, 02:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T22:57:29-08:00","id":64620,"title":"","content":"Jesus Christ, I had no idea.<br /> <br /> Is there anything I can do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T05:53:08-08:00","id":64772,"title":"","content":"You are the type of person I want to win the lottery. Just so you can laugh at your family.<br /> <br /> Anyway, God bless. I hope things work out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","name":"Jack","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T06:17:35-08:00","id":64790,"title":"","content":"Piece of shit son of the ex fianc\u00e9e friggin poured spray paint on the wall and let it seep into the cats food and water! I come downstairs and the food and water are empty and vomit is by them, he told me he would give them food and water, and the one day I don't go down there myself not only is there no food and water but he poisons them! Piece of shit! I moved my cats to my room they are scared thirsty and starving. I hope they are okay and avoided the fucken paint. This is the only time any of you witnessed me dropping the F-bomb and saying shit but these are my fucken cats they are screwing with. Okay I am the only one taking care of the cats, I need to get the two cats that are not mine into a shelter. Can anyone help me with that? Jesus I still have to go to a doctors appointment I don't have money for and convince them to see me. This is a horrible fucken birthday. I hate this place so damn much I need to get out of here. My poor cats better be okay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T06:22:19-08:00","id":64793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=64620#post64620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jesus Christ, I had no idea. Is there anything I can do?</div> </div> </div> </div> Any advice and morale support would be appreciated. I'm scared, lost and depressed everyday. I don't know what to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T06:27:14-08:00","id":64796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jack</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=64772#post64772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are the type of person I want to win the lottery. Just so you can laugh at your family. Anyway, God bless. I hope things work out.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you. I'd be content if I never had to see most of my family ever again. My handful of friends are more family then these monsters. My last grandma is dying today at a hospice in California I wish I could see her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T07:30:37-08:00","id":64825,"title":"","content":"Now my grandmother passed away. This morning on my birthday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T07:58:08-08:00","id":64837,"title":"","content":"...God, I'm so sorry, Eldagusto. I hope you're holding up alright, but I can't imagine how you must be feeling right now. I don't know if hugs are a thing you're ok with, but *hugs* So many hugs. Stay as connected with your friends as you can (this means US! too) /until you weather out this storm. From what I've read of your life here and on the old forums, I know that your friends will be there. I know that holds true here too. <br /> <br /> \u200bHere when needed,<br /> -Azrael","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:04:38-08:00","id":64841,"title":"","content":"Also, I officially grant you, by the power of the Dysfunctional Posters of the OPP forums, a birthday do-over. <br /> <br /> \u200bYou can pick any day of the year you like, and that's this year's birthday.<br /> \u200bYou birthday up that birthday like you're 8 years old again, sir.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf I were close, I would personality take you to Chuck E. Cheese, where you could trounce me at Skeeball and Whack-a-Mole.<br /> <br /> \u200bDo-over birthday, courtesy of us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:06:53-08:00","id":64845,"title":"","content":"Why? Because you deserve to be happy, healthy and treated well so Damn much. <br /> \u200bStay strong. You're not alone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:24:18-08:00","id":64858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=64825#post64825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now my grandmother passed away.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry for your loss, man. But for all it's worth, it sounds like your grandmother was ready to be free of whatever disease had put her on hospice in the first place, so if you have any room in your heart for something other than mourning, maybe there's a bit of comfort in knowing she's no longer sick. Faint comfort, sure, but any port in a storm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T08:27:59-08:00","id":64859,"title":"","content":"Thank you so much. That actually made me cry. I'm shaken up having just talked with my sister on the phone. I hate that a piece of crap like her is the one who told me a loved one just passed away. Now I find out my brother isn't moving out, so now the house will be crowded, and ill have to go back to hiding. I just found this out a minute ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:06:55-08:00","id":64889,"title":"","content":"I hope you find a way to relax, Elda. Being sick is bad enough without this horrendous level of grief and stress piled onto it. I want so much to give you some kind of real, tangible comfort. I wish I could. I'm generally the kind of guy that reserves hugs for small children, kittens and my Grandma, but I seriously want to hug you right now. <br /> I want to say something meaningful that would help you, but everything I come up with sounds like some pointless anecdote or unhelpful rejected pep-talk material, so I'll just say this:<br /> <br /> \u200bLife can be overwhelming and scary. It can make you feel helpless and hopeless. The thing is, those terrible feelings, like all feelings, can soften in time and be replaced with better ones. <br /> It might be escapism, but putting yourself mentally in that desired situation can help a little, I find; feeling physically and emotionally better, living with your friend(s) and your cats in a stable home where you can relax and be safe. Someplace warm, peaceful, quiet and cozy, where you can keep your gaming books wherever you damn well please.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf you ever need to just vent at a random person, I'm just a PM, email or Skype message away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T09:35:09-08:00","id":64920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=64858#post64858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I'm sorry for your loss, man. But for all it's worth, it sounds like your grandmother was ready to be free of whatever disease had put her on hospice in the first place, so if you have any room in your heart for something other than mourning, maybe there's a bit of comfort in knowing she's no longer sick. Faint comfort, sure, but any port in a storm.</div> </div> </div> </div> No I'm happy she no longer in pain. I've seen to many people die of Cancer to know what it's like in the final days. My grandmother was old and healthy for her age. She was going through dementia most of my life that I saw her. But olives the few times I got to spend with her. She spoke languages From the Philippines more often then English, and I stopped speaking those languages in elementary school so kept having to say speak English grandma. But it was nice because she loved me unconditionally even if communication was an issue, it was bogged down with the politics like the rest of the crap I deal with in the family. If my mom was still alive I would of seen my grandmother more, but my dad moved our family to the otherwise of the country so the family in California treats me different like I chose to leave California or Apparently they were letting people talk to her on Skype yesterday but no one bothered to tell me...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T14:13:15-08:00","id":65130,"title":"","content":"I spent the day either waiting in a line or waiting in the rain for various rides. The doctors wouldn't see me and told me to go to the Department of Social Services because I need medical attention, but the DSS told me unless I'm blind or going to die immediately then if I'm between the ages of 22 and 64 the. I'm not disabled, and if I'm not disabled I will get no medical assistance. She said I have the ER to help me for my medical problems, and I said the ER is the one who said I need to see a primary care doctor, but she didn't care. She was smug and unnecessarily condescending the whole time. I have literally no recourse for medical attention here. On a side note my cats are super clingy now that they are safe in my room. They must of been over 24 hours with only some food and water tainted by paint. They seem okay, but I'm pissed and worried for them. This never should have happened to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T15:01:09-08:00","id":65168,"title":"","content":"I would wish you a happy birthday, but that seems unlikely now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=64793#post64793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Any advice and morale support would be appreciated. I'm scared, lost and depressed everyday. I don't know what to do.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure what I can do for advice. I'm not terribly wise and I've never been through what you're experiencing.<br /> <br /> I guess I can tell you what I do when I'm feeling overwhelmed. I find something good I can do, and I do it. I don't necessarily mean something morally good, I mean something I'll be happy to have done.<br /> <br /> So at the end of the day, I can say &quot;at least I did X&quot;.<br /> <br /> As for moral support, well...<br /> <br /> Your health situation will probably get better. Terrible as American healthcare is, I hear it's improving.<br /> <br /> I care about you. We may never have met in person, but I know you from here and I think your happiness matters.<br /> <br /> Most people are better than your family. Most people are decent, and will help people who need it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T17:33:18-08:00","id":65258,"title":"","content":"Sorry about your grandma passing on this day. I wish I can speak my people's language but we have been assimilated almost a hundred years ago. Elisabeth's grandfather (paternal) could speak Tagalog but he died so long ago we doubt he knows about her. I know if her dad tried to speak it, he was beaten by his stepdad. <br /> Best wishes to you...instant thought...go to a church and talk to a parson, priest or preacher. Explain your problem with the merry-go-round you are dealing with. Maybe they can get a doctor to view your case pro bono and start the paperwork stating that you are considered disabled. Sign a records release sheet for your records from Michigan so the doctor will have a clearer picture of what is happening. File for SSI or SSDI with a copy of the medical records. With the way your family is acting, DO NOT allow any of them to be a Representative Payee for you. See if the church can act as your Payee. If you get the groundwork going, apply for section 8 housing and find a decent place to live, away from family. Get away from what is making you sick, both mentally and physically. I had to get away from what was making me ill...staying with my Mom is probably the sanest thing I have done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T08:01:03-08:00","id":71981,"title":"","content":"Oh Jesus I just found out I won't be getting really any tax refund this year, I only got them before because of Schooling, and I didn't go to school in 2013 due to my medical problems! God now I have to figure out if I can somehow borrow enough money from my friends to get on a plane to Michigan with my cats. I'm so scared, I don't know what to do! Even if I get to Michigan I'm probably going to have to stay at a homeless shelter or something, and its still cold there so my health problems will go nuts. God I'm so scared I need to medical attention though. God!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T08:32:13-08:00","id":71994,"title":"","content":"Jesus, will they allow me to take my pets from NC to Michigan as is or do I have to go through Complicated procedures to get some sort of certificate? I think it will only cost 250 to take them with me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T09:09:28-08:00","id":72008,"title":"","content":"it looks like you would need proof of rabies shots and a certificate of health issued by a vet within the 10 days before you travel. This is not an absolute, just some quick google-searching on my part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T09:14:27-08:00","id":72020,"title":"","content":"Jesus Christ I don't know any Vets here and I don't have any money!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T09:54:59-08:00","id":72040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=72020#post72020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jesus Christ I don't know any Vets here and I don't have any money!</div> </div> </div> </div>There is also a note that they only randomly bother with such checks, and only at state border checkpoints if you happen to be driving. That would technically be illegal but apparently happens rather a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T10:33:08-08:00","id":72061,"title":"","content":"God if I was transporting by car it would be way easier. My only option at this point is plane. Has anyone travelled with cats on a plane? Do they always require this? God I can't even ask these questions on face book because my messed up family will cause trouble for me if I rear my head up on Facebook. I feel so isolated...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T11:07:44-08:00","id":72086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/25177-god-i-m-terrified-and-i-just-want-to-warm-safe-and-have-my-old-doctors-back?p=72061#post72061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">God if I was transporting by car it would be way easier. My only option at this point is plane. Has anyone travelled with cats on a plane? Do they always require this? God I can't even ask these questions on face book because my messed up family will cause trouble for me if I rear my head up on Facebook. I feel so isolated...</div> </div> </div> </div>Airlines are supposed to check as a matter of course. They've been making a point the last year or so of cracking down on staff that don't follow procedure on transporting pets because there has been a higher than usual number of mistakes that were costly to the airlines in terms of PR. <br /> <br /> I myself have not traveled with pets but I'm an anal ass that actually reads through the requirements and procedures for such things.<br /> <br /> Some airlines are relaxing requirements to the point where a pet that is quiet and well behaved can travel with the passenger in the cabin provided there is room for such. Generally though they get loaded into pet carriers (many vets recommend mild to moderate sedation for the stresses of the trip) and make the trip in a pressurized cargo hold. If you want them to be on the same flight as you, you generally need to arrange things with the airline ahead of time as not all flights have pressurized cargo holds.<br /> <br /> <br /> That would change however if you were able to get to a mental health professional and have them declared as service animals. Then they gain a number of legal protections and organizations have restrictions on being largely unable to separate them from you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T18:37:02-08:00","id":73493,"title":"","content":"My friend is making appointments to speak to a couple pastors to see if I can have somewhere to live.<br /> <br /> God even figuring out a method to get there is stressful, and thinking about what to do once I get there is mind bendingly terrifying.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to take my mind off of things by playing chess on my phone or trying to read Dave's Actual Plays, but its like an opiate after wards everything rushes back and my anxiety is crippling. I feel this crushing inevitability of doom on my part.<br /> <br /> My whole life I wish my mom was alive to comfort me, but I'm all alone. By the time I stopped being a teen I feel constant dread from my medical problems. My life should never have collapsed to this point. God I wish I had some guidance but I have no one to turn to, and only one person that even talks to me. Jesus I want a hug so badly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T18:37:32-08:00","id":74012,"title":"","content":"Here, have an online hug.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/43356063/Webcomic%20Snips/Non-What/Hug.PNG\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-18T21:12:19-08:00","id":74772,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I thought I was doing better today but I had a bad episode out of nowhere and now that I got my muscles to partially relax I feel like Someone beat the crap out of me. I finally told an old roommate and friend about my situation and she says she is going to pay for my plane ticket to Michigan. I just need to find out where I'm gonna stay like a church or a shelter. I still feel so ashamed getting help. All this time my family hammering in that they are the only ones who would ever help me, yet when it comes down to it it's a small handful of friends who are the only ones who can't stand to see me suffer like this. My family who have the power to help but choose not to meanwhile friends with less to give are giving more even without being under any obligations of blood. And again she was the third to mention starting a fund raiser to help me, and I told I was to terrified of not getting better and having a backlash of anger of everything being wasted on me. She says its rediculous but that is literally what happened trying to get help from my family. God I hope things work out. It was really difficult revealing my medical problems to a female friend. I've tried so hard to keep my medical, and family, problems a secret from everyone not just my friends but also my school and potential employers. And now I'm telling everyone and resorting to begging. Oddly enough those that are helping me aren't requiring me to beg, and are choosing to help me. Yet those I literally beg to choose not to help me. I hope I can sleep without have another medical episode. And I don't know when to tell my brother I'm going back to Michigan. I don't know how he's going to re-act...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T09:39:44-08:00","id":76344,"title":"","content":"Yeah so my brother was swallowing a bunch of pills in a self destructive plea for attention. His ex wife got him to throw a bunch of them up and had me watch him while she went to work. He was faking being unresponsive trying to listen to how we'ed react. She knew what he was doing though. He gets up minutes later when some arrives to fix his truck. He sneaks his keys out and drives down the block to get a part, while I was going to call the cops because he is in no condition to drive he got back before the cops where called. This is disgusting. He found out I'm trying to get back to Michigan and that I heard about his women beating. He said some BS about its impossible that he hit his ex fianc\u00e9 because he is a badass martial artist and no way she could have only gotten a black eye from him if he was serious. He said she got a black eye from restraining her in self defense. And his ex wife gives me this disgusting BS about how all boyfriends/husbands hit their significant other sometimes, which disgusted me to the core. These people are sick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T23:02:45-08:00","id":76881,"title":"","content":"Wow. That's terrible.<br /> <br /> And speaking as a martial artist...your brother's excuse is the absolute worst.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T23:14:55-08:00","id":82526,"title":"","content":"God I'm in a corner. I've been trying to get in touch which churches in Michigan where I'm trying to go back to but it's constantly being delayed. I'm trying not to but I'm having anxiety attacks. I've literally been hiding in a small room with the lights off for two months, and before that hiding in a cold dark and loud basement for 4 months. I don't know what to do. I'm so depressed and terrified. I can only keep it away for so long before reality comes crashing down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T17:28:46-07:00","id":102266,"title":"","content":"I believe I'm going back to Michigan by next weekend. Downside is my plans on a specific place to stay did not work out. I'm going to drop my stuff off at a friends Garage. Drop my Cats somewhere else, and hope the Clinc/hospital can help me. Goodside I am going to be able to bring all my stuff, downside is well I hope I can keep it in my friend's garage till I can figure out where to put it. I may have to purge more of my possession but i've already done that multiple times, whats left is already the sentimental/ valuable stuff.<br /> <br /> God I hope this goes well. At least I'll get access to my medicines at the free clinic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-03T08:09:36-07:00","id":104826,"title":"","content":"That is a bad situation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2639-georgea","name":"georgea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-04T05:42:10-07:00","id":105520,"title":"","content":"It is certainly terrifying, preciate your first post on the forums being here.<br /> <br /> I'm going tomorrow. Gonna pack today when the Uhaul is acquired. It feels somewhat like taking a step off a cliff since I'm essentially fighting to move my position to homelessness, but I do not feel safe where I am at. I need to see my doctors and leave this messed up house much more then I need this roof over my head. I need to go now while the warm season is starting. Maybe if I time things right I can sleep through the car trip and thus avoid the lion's share of the anxiety of being stuck in the car with my brother.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-07T05:14:04-07:00","id":107376,"title":"","content":"I'm in a homeless state of mendicancy right now, but I feel a lot better, I finally got sleep, and Today most of my destinations are open since its the weekday. I'll hopefully be able to accomplish some important things soonish. I really feel better back home away from the hellish households I was stuck with for a year. Now the Library and Wifi spots allow me to check the forum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}